 "not_run": {
  "source_file": "one frame per file on this corpus (117 files, 117 frames), so the target is in bijection with frame_id: 117 single-sample classes at frame level, and at crop level the frame-leakage guard puts every class wholly inside one CV fold. `session_id` is the runnable coarsening \u2014 see ssl_us.eval.stanford_targets",
  "full-depth band": "K=16 >= 8 sits below PLAN.md \u00a73.2c's 8 mm sector-occupancy floor, which applies identically to both corpora \u2014 the restricted band IS the arm here, not a subset of a wider one",
  "K=8 column": "K sets the stem's input channel count, so this cell needs its own VICReg run; no trained pair found for this K"
 },
